{"title":"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The integer that must replace the square so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e60ec59e8a4caa2dbff1ab3e12f6f9dbd1512562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\square - 3 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f3c11a46aa1819b4923516a5d5fae0d4c0dc77a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 9\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to both sides of the equation, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c247c86a5a8e2de1a7188fda7331bfd25f5b93a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\square = 5 + 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid blac